    obo:IAO_0000116 "Provisional FLOPO bearer; PO submission pending. Curator-approved FLOPO-local anatomy support class FLOPO_LOCAL:leaf_scar (Robert Hoehndorf, 2026-09-18; curation/flopo_anatomy_support_classes_20260918.tsv). PO check: PO has leaf abscission zone PO:0006501, the zone before shedding. Replace with the PO identifier via IAO:0100001 once assigned. No PO identifier is minted locally."@en ;
